@startuml
' Figure 25.4  Manifest hash in the trail
' Reading order: top to bottom. The deploy check hashes the effective
' harness and asks the registry; only a registered hash starts. Every
' step then writes the version and hash into the trail.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Deploy" as D <<ops>>
participant "Registry" as R <<evidence>>
participant "Harness" as H <<ops>>
participant "Trail" as T <<evidence>>
D -> R : registered?
R --> D : yes, 1.0.0
D -> H : start
H -> T : step + hash
H -> T : step + hash
H -> T : stop + hash
@enduml
